  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 600); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2308.03); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13358, eff 4-1-22",
